Monty includes selected modules from CPython under the accompanying Python licence.
The upstream revision is recorded in vendor.toml. Monty embeds the source and
compiles it on import. The colorsys source is unmodified. In keyword, Monty
replaces the bound frozenset membership methods with Python functions. In stat,
Monty removes the optional _stat accelerator import. In textwrap, Monty calls
pattern.search directly and uses __name__ rather than __qualname__ in dedent's
TypeError. In io, Monty removes the abstract base classes, the Reader and Writer
protocols and the _io names it does not provide. See patches/ for the source changes.
